<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Brand Creative</title>

<style>

*{
  box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
  margin:0;
  background:#e9e5df;
  font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:50px;
}

/* LINKEDIN CREATIVE */
.creative{
  width:1080px;
  height:1080px;
  background:#f7f3ed;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  padding:90px;

  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  justify-content:space-between;

  box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
}

/* small label */
.label{
  font-size:20px;
  letter-spacing:4px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#a75d3b;
}

/* main text */
h1{
  font-family:Georgia, serif;
  font-size:92px;
  line-height:1.02;
  font-weight:400;
  max-width:820px;
  margin:30px 0;
  color:#20201e;
}

.highlight{
  color:#a75d3b;
  font-style:italic;
}

.description{
  font-size:30px;
  line-height:1.5;
  max-width:650px;
  color:#55514c;
}

/* bottom */
.footer{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:end;
  border-top:1px solid #cfc7bc;
  padding-top:25px;
}

.name{
  font-family:Georgia, serif;
  font-size:27px;
  font-style:italic;
}

.category{
  font-size:15px;
  letter-spacing:3px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}

/* decorative circle */
.circle{
  width:330px;
  height:330px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:#d9c4ae;
  position:absolute;
  right:-100px;
  top:-100px;
  opacity:.55;
}

.small-circle{
  width:120px;
  height:120px;
  border-radius:50%;
  border:1px solid #a75d3b;
  position:absolute;
  right:80px;
  bottom:150px;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="creative">

  <div class="circle"></div>
  <div class="small-circle"></div>

  <div>

    <div class="label">
      Everyday Brand Observations
    </div>

    <h1>
      It wasn't just
      <span class="highlight">coffee.</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="description">
      Sometimes, what we're really paying for
      isn't the product.
      <br><br>
      It's how the experience makes us feel.
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="footer">

    <div class="name">
      Preeti Mishra
    </div>

    <div class="category">
      Brand Strategy × Consumer Behaviour
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
